The '''Transhumanist Revolution''' was a period of socio-political and socio-cultural transformation in [[Geno]] following the [[2328 Genonian presidential election]]. [[PERSON]] of the [[Transhumanist Party]] became president, and began to eliminate political opposition and consolidate power. The country was renamed into the [[Geno|Transhumanist Republic of Geno]] and the constitution modified to make the Transhumanist Party the sole political party and ideology of the republic. Mass protests erupted from the newly outlawed opposition parties, which were effectively crushed by the new government forces. 



